  "code": "const int LEDS[6] = {2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7};\nconst int BTN = 8;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) pinMode(LEDS[i], OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(BTN, INPUT_PULLUP);\n  randomSeed(analogRead(A5));\n}\n\nvoid show(int n) {\n  for (int i = 0; i < 6; i++) digitalWrite(LEDS[i], i < n ? HIGH : LOW);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  if (digitalRead(BTN) == LOW) {\n    for (int i = 0; i < 12; i++) {   // \"rolling\" animation that slows down\n      show(random(1, 7));\n      delay(60 + i * 15);\n    }\n    show(random(1, 7));\n    while (digitalRead(BTN) == LOW) {}\n  }\n}\n",
  "test": {
    "mn": "Товч дарахад LED-үүд гүйж, 1–6 ширхэг LED асаж зогсоно.",
    "en": "Press the button: the LEDs flicker, then stop with 1 to 6 LEDs on."
  },
  "safety": [
    {
      "mn": "Arduino-г зөвхөн USB (5В)-ээр тэжээнэ. Утас солихдоо USB-г салгана.",
      "en": "Power the Arduino from USB (5V) only. Unplug USB before you change wires."
    },
    {
      "mn": "LED-ийг резисторгүйгээр батарейд шууд холбож болохгүй — шатна.",
      "en": "Never connect an LED straight to the battery without its resistor — it burns out."
    }
  ],
